        "category": "grammar",
        "english": "PROBLEM 3: Verb in 3D 3 BIG STRUCTURES ------------------------------------ - Normal subject (3 BIG STRUCTURES) - WH-subject = WH-word (interrogative words) - Reverse subject - No subject (\"virtual\" subject) | Động từ và chủ ngữ (cấu trúc CÂU) 2 types of verb (semantics): BE / NORMAL VERB 2 types of verb (quantity): Plural and singular 3 types of structure/each type of verb (+/-/?) = 12 cases!",
        "vietnamese": "",
        "speaker": null,
        "audio_url": "https://storage.googleapis.com/chunks-mirror-audio-284566312743/level_a/day_8/chunk_la_d8_0004.mp3",
